system:
UNCONFIGURED PLACEHOLDER. No grading instructions have been supplied.
The evaluator blocks model invocation until the approved judge prompt is integrated.

user:
Reserved inputs: messages, rubric_dimensions, tool_definitions, test_case_description.
Reserved internal JSON output:
{"dimensions":[{"id":"<exact rubric ID>","score":0,"reason":"<brief explanation>"}]}
There must be exactly one result per supplied dimension, with a numeric score of 0 or 1.
Numeric grading details are internal, not customer-facing results.
